story, you’ve lost your moment. On  today, a one-minute beat is
more welcome than a three-minute scene, and if you’re starting page four
of a single 区, that’s a red flag.
Notice also that I’m using the words “minute” and “page” interchange¬
ably. That’s just shorthand. A minute per page may be an average, but it’s
not always accurate. Pages of ő move נ, while action eats up
lots of time. As with all my Ƹtion ž. I’m pointing out a general
