it’s not going to fit into any of the ğ stories. They’d have to give
me an episode that’s a one-off that has nothing to do with this giant arc.
To me the show is most effective when it’s ی more than one story,
cross-А between the ups and downs of various characters. You want
the show to not be ǋ resolved. The show is at its best when it’s not
a 【ity play: so it’s not — by the end of the show that the right
thing to do was X. Sometimes I want to 円 at the end of the show
