beat. 1. A scene or step of the story; 2. A pause in Ö or action.
beat sheet. Also see outline. A list of events ĕ in the
story, often त in numbered scenes, though sometimes more gener¬
ally in sequences or even إ of γ acts.
BIBLE. A guide to the series, especially for writers and ə joining
